# Julian Bashir, Frontier Doctor: "return target creature card with mana value X or less from your graveyard to the battlefield,
# where X is Julian Bashir's power." Exactly at the limit: Grizzly Bears (mana value 2) dies trading with Savannah Lions on
# turn 3, and on turn 5 Julian's second draw makes him a 2/2, so the Bears, mana value 2 = power 2, is a legal target and
# returns (CR 107.1b, 202.3).

